@ohitsfrancesco 30-week SMA breakout or 200-day SMA reclaim + the moving average starting to slope higher.

Ideally, I also want to see price breaking out of the Stage 1 base with strong volume + relative strength improving.

That’s when I start viewing it as a Stage 1 → Stage 2 transition. https://t.co/Ewkbd05P2H

